# Me2Cloud: hosts used by the latency test, to be sent DIRECT. 25 rules, generated 2026-10-27.
# https://m2c.1ms.dog/ · https://github.com/yt1988/me2cloud
# AWS · DynamoDB /ping
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,dynamodb.*.amazonaws.com
# AWS · DynamoDB /ping · China
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,dynamodb.*.amazonaws.com.cn
# Oracle Cloud · Object Storage
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,objectstorage.*.oraclecloud.com
# Vultr · Looking glass
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*-ping.vultr.com
# Microsoft Azure · Cognitive Services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.cognitive.microsoft.com
# Google Cloud · Storage regional endpoint (rep)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,rep.googleapis.com
# Alibaba Cloud · OSS
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,oss-*.aliyuncs.com
# Tencent Cloud · COS
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,cos.*.myqcloud.com
# Huawei Cloud · OBS
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,obs.*.myhuaweicloud.com
# Akamai (Linode) · Object Storage
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,linodeobjects.com
# DigitalOcean · Spaces
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,digitaloceanspaces.com
# OVHcloud · Speed test (proof)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,speedtest.network.ovh.net
# OVHcloud · Speed test (proof) · Gravelines
DOMAIN,proof.ovh.net
# Hetzner · Speed test
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*-speed.hetzner.com
# AWS · DynamoDB /ping · IPv6
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,dynamodb.*.api.aws
# Alibaba Cloud · OSS · IPv6
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.oss.aliyuncs.com
# IBM Cloud · Cloud Object Storage
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,s3.*.cloud-object-storage.appdomain.cloud
# Scaleway · Object Storage
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,s3.*.scw.cloud
# Volcengine · TOS
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,tos-*.volces.com
# Baidu AI Cloud · BOS
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.bcebos.com
# Naver Cloud · Object Storage
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.object.ncloudstorage.com
# Me2Cloud network check (Cloudflare)
DOMAIN,speed.cloudflare.com
# Me2Cloud network check (Cloudflare)
DOMAIN,www.cloudflare.com
# Me2Cloud network check (Cloudflare)
